sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Biller as External Biller
    participant API as PayLink Payment Service
    participant Wallet as Wallet & Ledger
    participant Audit as Audit Log
    participant Notif as Notification Service
    actor Customer

    Note over API,Wallet: Precondition: Payment is SentToBiller and funds are held in wallet

    Biller->>API: Biller response / callback (paymentReference, outcome)
    API->>API: Check current payment state & duplicate callback

    alt Payment already Failed / Refunded (Duplicate callback)
        API->>Audit: Log duplicate failure callback (ignored)
        API-->>Biller: Acknowledge (no duplicate release)
    else Biller confirms failure while SentToBiller (or Unknown)
        API->>API: Transition status -> Failed
        API->>Audit: Record Failed state transition

        API->>Wallet: Release held funds (amount, paymentReference)
        Wallet->>Wallet: Append immutable RELEASE_HOLD ledger entry
        Wallet-->>API: Updated available & held balances (derived)

        API->>API: Transition status -> Refunded
        API->>Audit: Record ledger release & Refunded state

        API->>Notif: Send SMS & Push failure notification (reason)
        loop Up to 3 retries if delivery fails
            Notif-->>Notif: Retry notification (mark Undelivered if exhausted)
        end
        Notif-->>Customer: SMS & Push (Payment Failed, funds released)
        API-->>Biller: Acknowledge
    else No confirmed refusal yet (Timeout / Status remains Unknown)
        API->>API: Keep status = Unknown (do NOT release held funds)
        API->>Audit: Log uncertain outcome (await retry / reconciliation)
        API-->>Customer: Notify processing still in progress (Unknown)
    end